# sign-photo function variables. Copy to .env and fill in.
#
# Generate the two PEM values with:
#   ./scripts/make-dev-cert.sh
#   base64 -i .certs/certificate.pem | tr -d '\n'   # -> C2PA_CERT_PEM
#   base64 -i .certs/private.key     | tr -d '\n'   # -> C2PA_PRIVATE_KEY_PEM
#
# They are base64 so their newlines survive an Appwrite function variable.
# Never commit the filled-in .env: the private key is what makes provenance
# signed by you unforgeable by anyone else.

# --- must be set on the function ------------------------------------------
C2PA_CERT_PEM=
C2PA_PRIVATE_KEY_PEM=
APPWRITE_BUCKET_ID=

# --- injected by the Appwrite runtime; set these only for local runs -------
APPWRITE_FUNCTION_API_ENDPOINT=
APPWRITE_FUNCTION_PROJECT_ID=
